# ChirpParade preset
format = 1
name = Woodpecker Drum
author = ChirpParade
description = Drumming only, and only on a note: Drum Rate is zero, so every note is one roll and nothing arrives unasked. Fourteen strikes accelerating by a quarter across the roll, which is what the library measures -- 22 of its 35 rolls speed up, against the usual claim that they slow down.
